# Laravel folders — lowercase naming

## Regola

Tutte le cartelle standard Laravel devono essere **lowercase**:

- `database/migrations/` (non `Migrations`)
- `database/factories/` (non `Factories`)
- `database/seeders/` (non `Seeders`)
- `app/Database/Migrations/` → `app/Database/migrations/`
- `tests/Feature/Database/Migrations/` → `tests/Feature/Database/migrations/`

## Canon Laravel

Laravel usa sempre lowercase per le cartelle standard. Uppercase crea incoerenza e problemi con composer autoloader/PSR-4.

## Fix

```bash
mv database/Migrations database/migrations
mv app/Database/Migrations app/Database/migrations
mv tests/Feature/Database/Migrations tests/Feature/Database/migrations
```

## Verifica

```bash
find . -type d -name "*[A-Z]*" | grep -E "(database|app|tests)"
```
